# DJ01: MIDI CC 106 (LFO 1 WAVE) = 40 on the auto channel (10, status b9), then CC 107 (LFO 1 SPH) = 99; the end
# snapshot's live kit shows where each value landed (stock: WAVE 6, the row's maximum; DJ01: 15).
wait-emu 0.5
tap semicolon        # MOD: LFO 1
wait-emu 0.5
midi-in b9 6a 28
wait-emu 0.5
midi-in b9 6b 63
wait-emu 0.5
png 00-cc40
